<statement>
<p>
Suppose that <m>\displaystyle{A}={\left\lbrace{4},{5},{6},{7}\right\rbrace}</m> and  <m>\displaystyle{B}={\left\lbrace{4},{5},{6},{7}\right\rbrace}</m>. Label each of the following as true or false.
</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{A}\subseteq{B}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li> true</li> 
<li> false</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{B}\subseteq{A}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li> true</li> 
<li> false</li> 
</ol></p>

</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>A:  true</li><li>A:  true</li></ul></p>
</solution>
